# CODEOWNERS — copy to ./CODEOWNERS or .github/CODEOWNERS and edit.
# Last matching pattern wins. Owners are auto-requested as reviewers.

# Harness & governance — senior-managed (team-wide blast radius).
/.claude/                 @senior
/governance.config.json   @senior
/.github/                 @senior
/CODEOWNERS               @senior

# Docs — open to all.
/docs/                    @team

